{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Wild Shapers</strong> is an action roguelike game where you evolve the battlefield itself in real-time through rune collection. Choose events and overcome trials to gather runes, then customize the stage's rules and environment to match your strategy. Design your optimal battlefield within limited time, then activate domains in your desired order during boss battles to create powerful combos by triggering domain effects in sequence. A completely new experience where you don't just fight on the battlefield\u2014you design it, evolve it, and engage in combat with it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4105020/extras/3eb475f1fb49741f5cb791602b56c5d5.webp?t=1762956133\" width=616 height=30 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>A World After the Apocalypse</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4105020/extras/08b699cf36eef7b2fb765fd8f71e3ed4.poster.avif?t=1762956133\" width=1170 height=498 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4105020/extras/08b699cf36eef7b2fb765fd8f71e3ed4.webm?t=1762956133\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4105020/extras/08b699cf36eef7b2fb765fd8f71e3ed4.mp4?t=1762956133\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Five calamities that brought the world to ruin. To uncover their origin, you obtain an ancient power that traverses spacetime and journey into the past. However, beings who cross timelines are recognized as foreign matter by spacetime itself. Everything except you instinctively becomes hostile. In this hostile world, you encounter the most influential beings in history. And you become a Shaper, a singularity that molds the battlefield.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4105020/extras/3eb475f1fb49741f5cb791602b56c5d5.webp?t=1762956133\" width=616 height=30 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Design the Battlefield with Runes</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4105020/extras/b557135480376ec588d5c9e8b4725b43.poster.avif?t=1762956133\" width=1170 height=498 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4105020/extras/b557135480376ec588d5c9e8b4725b43.webm?t=1762956133\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4105020/extras/b557135480376ec588d5c9e8b4725b43.mp4?t=1762956133\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose events and overcome trials to acquire Magic, Rare, Legendary, and Primal grade runes. These runes are not simple power-ups. They grant localized buffs, activate effects in specific domains, and rewrite the rules of entire maps. The battlefield evolves in real-time based on your collected rune combinations, and the same stage unfolds differently each playthrough. Experience a completely new layer of gameplay where you design and manipulate not just character growth, but the battlefield itself. Construct the optimal battlefield within 15 minutes of limited time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4105020/extras/3eb475f1fb49741f5cb791602b56c5d5.webp?t=1762956133\" width=616 height=30 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Activate Domains and Dominate the Battlefield</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4105020/extras/111388a1b37e30087d766bae0549a9c3.poster.avif?t=1762956133\" width=1170 height=498 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4105020/extras/111388a1b37e30087d766bae0549a9c3.webm?t=1762956133\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4105020/extras/111388a1b37e30087d766bae0549a9c3.mp4?t=1762956133\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After Time Zero, you can directly summon shrines and activate domains during combat. The accumulated power of all the runes you've collected explodes into action. Combine domain-specific buffs and debuffs, adjust your strategy in real-time, and use the battlefield itself as a weapon. Face overwhelming beings as the true power of the battlefield you designed reveals itself.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unleash infinite strategies with different rune combinations each playthrough and experience thrilling combat as you sweep through endless waves of enemies. An evolving battlefield, a world that responds to you. Beings you encounter across time. Their truth is revealed through multiple encounters. Become a singularity in spacetime and embark on a journey to find the origin of the apocalypse.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4105020?t=1762956133","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4105020/fb15f1f71384633870f272f8b52d72ce0e0ce268/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1762956133","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4105020/266e7ca2abb768a0809bc9feb51b7936dd328da8/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1762956133","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4105020/266e7ca2abb768a0809bc9feb51b7936dd328da8/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1762956133","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Wild Shapers</strong> is an action roguelike game where you evolve the battlefield itself in real-time through rune collection. Choose events and overcome trials to gather runes, then customize the stage's rules and environment to match your strategy. Design your optimal battlefield within limited time, then activate domains in your desired order during boss battles to create powerful combos by triggering domain effects in sequence. A completely new experience where you don't just fight on the battlefield\u2014you design it, evolve it, and engage in combat with it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4105020/extras/3eb475f1fb49741f5cb791602b56c5d5.webp?t=1762956133\" width=616 height=30 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>A World After the Apocalypse</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><