\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4105020/extras/b557135480376ec588d5c9e8b4725b43.mp4?t=1762956133\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose events and overcome trials to acquire Magic, Rare, Legendary, and Primal grade runes. These runes are not simple power-ups. They grant localized buffs, activate effects in specific domains, and rewrite the rules of entire maps. The battlefield evolves in real-time based on your collected rune combinations, and the same stage unfolds differently each playthrough. Experience a completely new layer of gameplay where you design and manipulate not just character growth, but the battlefield itself. Construct the optimal battlefield within 15 minutes of limited time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4105020/extras/3eb475f1fb49741f5cb791602b56c5d5.webp?t=1762956133\" width=616 height=30 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Activate Domains and Dominate the Battlefield</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4105020/extras/111388a1b37e30087d766bae0549a9c3.poster.avif?t=1762956133\" width=1170 height=498 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4105020/extras/111388a1b37e30087d766bae0549a9c3.webm?t=1762956133\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4105020/extras/111388a1b37e30087d766bae0549a9c3.mp4?t=1762956133\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After Time Zero, you can directly summon shrines and activate domains during combat. The accumulated power of all the runes you've collected explodes into action. Combine domain-specific buffs and debuffs, adjust your strategy in real-time, and use the battlefield itself as a weapon. Face overwhelming beings as the true power of the battlefield you designed reveals itself.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unleash infinite strategies with different rune combinations each playthrough and experience thrilling combat as you sweep through endless waves of enemies. An evolving battlefield, a world that responds to you. Beings you encounter across time. Their truth is revealed through multiple encounters. Become a singularity in spacetime and embark on a journey to find the origin of the apocalypse.</p>","developers":["Idea Bombers"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4105020/e2d7a05be74390e24268ec6049e6577451b265ee/header.jpg?t=1762956133","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4105020/1119098914/d710354bdb2f6807fb4e4bfb20850b08ea3c0718/1762495353/dash_av1.mpd?t=1762956132","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4105020/1119098914/d710354bdb2f6807fb4e4bfb20850b08ea3c0718/1762495353/dash_h264.mpd?t=1762956132","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4105020/1119098914/d710354bdb2f6807fb4e4bfb20850b08ea3c0718/1762495353/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1762956132","id":257228064,"mp4":{"480":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257228064/movie480.mp4?t=1762956132","max":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers